==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
{{etyl|ang|en}} {{m|ang|redic}}, {{term|rædic}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|rādīce}}, the ablative singular of {{m|la|rādix||root}}; later readopted from {{etyl|fr|en}} {{m|fr|radis}}, from {{etyl|pt|en}} {{m|pt|raditz}}, from Latin. Also see: ''[[eradicate]]''.
[[Image:Raphanus_sativus.jpg|thumb|right|200px|a bowl of radishes]]

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈɹædɪʃ/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|En-us-radish.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|es}}

# A [[plant]] of the ''[[Brassicaceae]]'' family, ''[[Raphanus sativus]]'', having an [[edible]] [[root]]
# The [[pungent]] root of this plant, usually eaten [[raw]] in [[salad]]s etc

